          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"memory-workflow\">Memory Workflow</h2></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "589a1e5b6fc4571d62eef3cb4b763127",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Three-step integration process:</strong></span>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Initialize:</strong> Create a <code>MemoryService</code> and\n    provide it to your agent via the <code>Runner</code></li>\n<li><strong>Ingest:</strong> Transfer <em>session</em> data to <em>memory</em>\n    using <code>add_session_to_memory()</code></li>\n<li><strong>Retrieve:</strong> Search stored memories using\n    <code>search_memory()</code></li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Xref",
      "code_hash": "b4ec46df8e95fe0274b7841aab101d12",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"initialize-memoryservice\">Initialize <code>MemoryService</code></h2></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "4ed17e189979a19c6ffba61516bbf255",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"initailize-memory\">Initailize Memory</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">ADK has multiple <code>MemoryService</code> implmentations\nthrough the <code>BaseMemoryService</code> interface:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>InMemoryMemoryService</code> - Built-in for\n    prototyping and testing (keyword matching,\n    no persistence)</li>\n<li><code>VertexAiMemoryBankService</code> - Managed cloud\n    service with LLM-powered consolidation\n    and semantic search</li>\n<li><strong>Custom Implementations</strong> - You can build\n    your own using databases (managed services\n    are recommended)</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "BYtC",
      "code_hash": "ab7ff7fb85e7033b25c3d67cf5985f2f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
