      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"creating-the-runner\">Creating the Runner</h3></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "nWHF",
      "code_hash": "2151df96ace46343a99b86c459a2116d",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Key configuration considerations:</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The <code>Runner</code> will need the following services\nto enable memory functionality:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>session_service</code>: Manages conversation threads\nand events</li>\n<li><code>memory_service</code>: Provides long-term knowledge\nstorage</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Both work together: Sessions capture convos,\nMemory stores knowledge for retreival across\nsessions.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "iLit",
      "code_hash": "3fe4285e0ee4cef306c4170921b84951",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": [
        {
          "type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": "Agent and Runner created with memory support! :)\n",
          "mimetype": "text/plain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ZHCJ",
      "code_hash": "f4272001066db7cf4f5ad57ca22dabf6",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#92;n&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;Configuration vs Usage:&lt;/span&gt;&#92;n&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;Adding &lt;code&gt;memory_service&lt;/code&gt; to the &lt;code&gt;Runner&lt;/code&gt;&#92;nmakes memory &lt;em&gt;available&lt;/em&gt; but not automatically&#92;nuse it.&lt;/span&gt;&#92;n&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;It must be explicitly:&lt;/span&gt;&#92;n&lt;ol&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingest data&lt;/strong&gt; using &#92;n&lt;code&gt;add_session_to_memory()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable retrieval&lt;/strong&gt; by giving your&#92;nagent memory tools&#92;n(&lt;code&gt;load_memory&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;preload_memory&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#92;n&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;warn&quot;'></marimo-callout-output>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ROlb",
      "code_hash": "1c41da90e080409a3855630046e3f759",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"memoryservice-implementation-options\"><code>MemoryService</code> Implementation Options</h3></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "qnkX",
      "code_hash": "5efe6e0fcd7daadd3a7de88fe64f7173",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><ul>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook: <code>InMemoryMemoryService</code></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Stores raw convo events <em>w/o</em> consolidation</li>\n<li>Keyword-based search (simple word matching)</li>\n<li>In-memory storage (resets on restart)</li>\n<li>Ideal for learning/local dev</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Production: <code>VertexAiMeoryBankService</code></span>\n<ul>\n<li>LLM-powered extraction of <em>key facts</em></li>\n<li>Semantic search (meaning-based retrieval)</li>\n<li>Persistent cloud storage</li>\n<li>Integrates external knowledge sources</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NOTE: There is nice API consistency/ DX - both\nimplementations use <em>identical</em> methods\n(<code>add_session_to_memory()</code>, <code>search_memory()</code>).\nSo this single workflow will apply to all\nmemory services.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "TqIu",
      "code_hash": "178b4ceee14013e78a25a78154f17fb3",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"ingest-session-data-into-memory\">Ingest Session Data into Memory</h2></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Vxnm",
      "code_hash": "7c2c0d4367c7a75367961c1faf95b14b",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Why should you transfer Session data to Memory?</span>\n</blockquote></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DnEU",
      "code_hash": "9591beed3033be92abb99b30bd6afeea",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><ul>\n<li>Now that memory is initialized, it's time\nto start populating with <em>knowledge</em>.</li>\n<li><code>MemoryService</code> starts empty.</li>\n<li>All convos stored in <em>Sessions</em></li>\n<li>Sessions contain <em>raw events</em></li>\n<li>raw events are: messages, tool calls and\nmetadata</li>\n<li>To make available to memory explicitly\ntransfer information with\n<code>add_session_to_memory()</code></li>\n<li>Prod will perform intelligent consolidation</li>\n<li>Let's get some data to store...</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ulZA",
      "code_hash": "98b57e8c63de9698b6d437f7397ea8f0",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": [
        {
          "type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": "\n### Session: conversation-01\n\nUser > My favorite color is sea-green. Can you write a Haiku about it?\nModel: > Sure, I can write a haiku about sea-green!\n\nOcean's gentle hue,\nCalm and deep, a peaceful sight,\nNature's cool embrace.\n",
          "mimetype": "text/plain"
        }
      ]
