          "text": "\ud83d\udcdd Session contains:\n  user: My favorite color is sea-green. Can you write a Haiku about ...\n  model: Sure, I can write a haiku about sea-green!\n\nOcean's gentle h...\n",
          "mimetype": "text/plain"
