    },
    {
      "id": "GTUi",
      "code_hash": "c876ace865e325963b8c3f89f4212c02",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"enable-memory-retrieval-in-our-agent\">Enable Memory Retrieval in Our Agent</h3></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "VQPT",
      "code_hash": "c0e877be99ec14bac0315ada395ee279",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Memory has been transferred. However, agents\n<strong>cannot directly access <code>MemoryService</code></strong>\nthey need tools to search it.  This is by\ndesign - for fine grain control.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jOLR",
      "code_hash": "fb750011142b25ec516df4e754626d66",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Memory Retrieval in ADK</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>load_memory</code> (<strong>Reactive</strong>)</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Agent decides when to search memory</li>\n<li>Only retrieves when agent thinks is needed</li>\n<li>More efficient/saves tokens</li>\n<li>Risk: Agent might forget to search</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>preload_memory</code> (<strong>Proactive</strong>)</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically searches before every turn</li>\n<li>Memory always available to agent</li>\n<li>Guaranteed context, but less efficient</li>\n<li>Searches even when not needed</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sdrA",
      "code_hash": "d1d81d454f33971fc7c8d462905ba61e",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"add-load-memory-tool-to-agent\">Add Load Memory Tool to Agent</h3></span>"
