        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Let's see the complete workflow in action.\nWe will:</span>\n<ol>\n<li>Have a conversation about a birthday</li>\n<li>Manually Save it to memory</li>\n<li>Test retrieval in a <em>new session</em></li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This demonstrates the full cycle:\n<strong>ingest -&gt; store -&gt; retrieve</strong></span></span>"
